question.en:
The click freezes the page for about 400 ms, and Interaction to Next Paint (INP), the responsiveness metric, reports a poor score. Which change actually helps?
```js
button.addEventListener('click', () => {
  for (const row of rows) {          // 5000 rows
    container.append(renderRow(row));
  }
});
```

