question.en:
What is the correct strategy for image delivery with modern formats such as WebP (Web Picture format) and lazy loading?
```js
const img = document.createElement('img');
img.src = 'image.jpg';
img.loading = 'lazy';
document.body.appendChild(img);
```
Which enhancement would provide the most performance benefit?

