```js
const img = document.createElement('img');
img.src = 'image.jpg';
img.loading = 'lazy';
document.body.appendChild(img);
```
Какое улучшение обеспечит наибольшую выгоду в производительности?

question.en:
In a modern bundler setup, what is the primary benefit of code splitting combined with dynamic imports?
```js
const module = await import('./heavy-feature.js');
module.init();
```
How does this approach improve Core Web Vitals?

